e issues, stress</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a><a href="/points/acupressure-points/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">BL23</div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">BL23 (Shenshu)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Kidney Shu</span></h3><div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Lower back pain, fatigue, vitality</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a><a href="/points/bl40-weizhong-acupressure-point/" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">BL40</div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">BL40 (Weizhong)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Popliteal Center</span></h3><div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★★★</div><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Lower back pain, sciatica, leg pain</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a></div><div class="text-center mt-10"><a href="/atlas/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-stone-500 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-400">← Back to Body Atlas</a></div></div>
